+**Ruling.** This repository adopts the recommendation as is:
+`TypeScript`, which it already uses for all of `src/` and `test/`
+(`tsconfig.json`, compiled with `tsc -p .`, linted with `gts`). The shell
+scripts and Kokoro configuration under `.kokoro/`, `owlbot.py`, and the
+fixtures of the ecosystems release-please supports are secondary languages
+and do not change the answer.
 
